decision collections

context: We need to work with collections of data throughout the application
decision: Use built-in list/dict/set types. Custom collections are records wrapping these.
rationale: Built-in types are well-optimized and familiar. Custom types wrap them for domain semantics.
enforcement: No custom list/dict implementations. Use record Node: items: list[T]
examples:
    ✓ record Stack: items: list[int]
    ✓ record Graph: nodes: list[Node], edges: dict[NodeId, list[NodeId]]
    ✗ Implementing custom linked list class
